{"html": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Yeeters — Caos de Jetpack no Seu Próprio Quintal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare-se para um caos aéreo onde agentes minúsculos com armas enormes transformam sua casa num campo de batalha! Bullet Yeeters é um caótico jogo de tiro em terceira pessoa com movimentação impulsionada por jetpack, física exagerada e ação explosiva em gigantescos ambientes domésticos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✈️ COMBATE DE JETPACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domine o movimento aéreo e supere seus inimigos em pleno voo. Use seu jetpack para desviar, esquivar e surpreender por cima.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/b4a36748fefe9cf9200c7bdaaef2811e.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/b4a36748fefe9cf9200c7bdaaef2811e.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏠 ZONAS DE GUERRA DOMÉSTICAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lute em cozinhas gigantes, garagens, salas de estar e muito mais. Objetos do dia a dia se transformam em coberturas táticas, armadilhas ou pontos altos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/8ae1c642df3b350875997332e4223b27.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/8ae1c642df3b350875997332e4223b27.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔫 AGENTES PERSONALIZADOS &amp; ARMAS ALUCINANTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desbloqueie e personalize agentes com habilidades únicas. Customize mochilas a jato, equipamentos e trajes. Escolha de um vasto arsenal de armas atualizáveis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/4507f31d90d6776d64c6bdb4c026e7b4.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/4507f31d90d6776d64c6bdb4c026e7b4.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 COMBATES ÉPICOS CONTRA CHEFÕES GIGANTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enfrente chefões ridiculamente enormes sozinho ou em cooperação. Cada batalha é um espetáculo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/fb69daf5e6953cccdc3a1d959d522ba3.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 CAOS TOTAL, DO SEU JEITO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O modo Free-for-All já está disponível no jogo, e os outros — incluindo Battle Royale, Control Point e The Floor is Lava — chegarão em breve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.poster.avif?t=1755849452\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/7da78057d7954f7ddf29d9db5ddb8b60.webm?t=1755849452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voe rápido. Atire com tudo. Yeet ou seja yeetado.</p>"}